meta {
  name: [Norce Adapter] Validate in Commerce
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{norceAdapterUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/validate
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  x-merchant: {{merchant}}
  x-channel: {{channel}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 400
}

docs {
  # Validate in Commerce

  Asks the Norce Adapter to compare the Checkout order with the Commerce basket (items, prices, shipping).

  **Expect `400` before shipping is chosen in the Walley checkout.** The Walley channel has `mapShippingFromNorceCommerce: false` and uses Walley's delivery module, so the Checkout order has no shipping until the shopper picks one in Walley, while the Commerce basket already has a freight fee. The response lists `validation-error-shipping-missing-in-checkout` and `validation-error-price-is-different`. Compare with the Kustom flow, where shipping is mapped from Commerce and this call returns `200`.
}

